        <item>
            <title>3.25.2</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 17:41:36 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>229</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.25.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes
- Session search stays fast as you keep typing: each added letter only rechecks the sessions the previous letters already matched.
- Search matches folder names stored in decomposed Unicode (common for Japanese and other accented names on macOS), and characters such as ß and ligatures now match their spelled-out forms consistently.
- The 100-session search limit no longer hides claude.ai cloud sessions.
- Less disk work right after launch when several session scans start at once.
]]></description>
